/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 105 0 R
/E (This project analyses retail sales transaction data using SQL to extract meaningful business insights. The dataset includes transaction details such as product category, quantity sold, pricing, total sales amount, and customer demographics \(age and gender\). Using SQL queries, the data is analysed to evaluate overall sales performance, identify top-performing product categories, understand sales trends over time, and analyse purchasing behaviour across different demographic groups. The project demonstrates the use of SQL aggregation, grouping, and filtering techniques to support data-driven retail decision-making.)
